OL,3,GNEWSAExxonMobil fined #267,000 over
OL,4,Achemical leaks at Mossmorran
OL,5,
OL,6,FExxonMobil said it accepted "full
OL,7,Fresponsibility" for the failures, but
OL,8,Fclaimed no workers, contractors or
OL,9,Fmembers of the public were at risk.
